    "text": "For the reaction<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvarian